# Package F "The Slow Boat": Kade hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(slow_boat), slow_boat_paid, slow_boat_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('slow_boat_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('slow_boat_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(slow_boat)') && HasItem('chiba_chip')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(slow_boat)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Easy money. A courier came in on the Chiba freighter with a chip for me. Somebody put a knife in him at the docks before my pickup. The chip walked.
#
o_text: Who took it?
o_id: slow_boat_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: slow_boat_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: Jalil. Smuggler, eastern residential, keeps his stock in a footlocker and the key round his neck. Bring me the chip, four hundred. Don't plug it into anything.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(slow_boat)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Jalil, east side. Footlocker. Chip. Simple.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (He sees the chip in your hand and goes very still.) You didn't plug it in. Tell me you didn't plug it in.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 400 sat, as agreed.
o_id: slow_boat_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: slow_boat_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: (He pockets it.) Berth lists. Who goes to the stars, and who doesn't. Now you know why the courier died. Forget it.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'chiba_chip', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 400)
effect: SetFlag('slow_boat_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Jalil says you came and went. Funny. He's buying drinks for the whole street now. Don't come back here.
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: Our business is done. Leave the door how you found it.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Door's behind you.
effect: EndConversation
